<p>Two days off, a group of friends or family, and the itch to get out of the city: that is the perfect recipe for a road trip. A <strong>tempo traveller for a weekend trip from Delhi</strong> keeps everyone together, fits all the bags and lets you stop at every dhaba along the way. Here are the 10 best weekend getaways from Delhi for groups, with distance, drive time and the best things to do.</p>

